OL,3,GNEWSANepalese man awaits friends update
OL,4,Aafter floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA restaurant owner from Nepal says he
OL,7,Fis "still waiting" to hear updates from
OL,8,Fhis friends following severe flash
OL,9,Fflooding.
OL,11,FAshutosh Lamichhane, who runs the Lost
OL,12,FYeti Kitchen and Bar in St Peter Port,
OL,13,FGuernsey, used to work as a river raft
OL,14,Fguide on the Bhote Koshi river along
OL,15,Fthe Nepal-Tibet border where the floods
OL,16,Foccurred on 26 August.
OL,18,FNearly 4,000 people remain unaccounted
OL,19,Ffor, including 639 hydropower workers,
OL,20,Fwith at least 939 known to have died.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
