OL,3,GNEWSANepalese man awaits friends update
OL,4,Aafter floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FLamichhane said "luckily and
OL,7,Fthankfully" all of his immediate family
OL,8,F"are OK" and the support he had
OL,9,Freceived from the island's community
OL,10,Fhad been important during the difficult
OL,11,Ftime.
